  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would represent inappropriate development that fails to meet very special circumstances for development on Metropolitan Open Land and fails to preserve the openness of the Metropolitan Open Land. As such the development is contrary to Section 13 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies G2 and G3 of the London Plan (2021), Policies CP30 and CP33 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD71 and DMD82 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposal, in the absence of an adequate flood risk assessment and sustainable drainage strategy, fails to demonstrate how proposed measures manage the risk of flooding and utilise Sustainable Urban Drainage Systems (SuDS) following the drainage hierarchy in the London Plan, contrary to Section 14 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan (2021), CP28 and CP29 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD59, DMD60, DMD61, DMD62, DMD63 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and the Enfield Strategic Flood Risk Assessment (2021)."
